    "1. Allow notifications so a background Wallet tap can confirm it was saved." : {

    },
    "2. Location is optional. When allowed, PickMe tries for a fresh fix for at most two seconds." : {

    },
    "3. In Shortcuts, create a Wallet Transaction automation that runs immediately. Add “Send Wallet Purchase to Inunity” and map Merchant, Amount, Name, Currency Code, and Card or Pass." : {

